	'messages:managewiki-header-extensions-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s extensions and skins from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to manage them\'\'\'. If you need an extension or skin enabled, please contact this wiki\'s operators.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-namespaces' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s namespace settings from this panel. Some settings will only reflect once you enable an extension. Consult MediaWiki documenation for further information. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-namespaces-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s namespace settings from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to change them\'\'\'. Contact wiki operators if you need further assistance.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-permissions' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s user group settings from this panel (such as permissions, group assignments and autopromotion). Please read the documentation very carefully and do not delete groups brazenly or your wiki may break. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds.

